# ─── AI / RAG Configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# OPTION A — Production RAG with OpenAI (recommended, secure):
#   1. Deploy Edge Function:  supabase functions deploy ai-chat
#   2. Set server secret:     supabase secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#   3. Enable proxy:
#
# VITE_USE_AI_PROXY=true
#
# OPTION B — Local dev (key visible in browser bundle — never commit):
#
# VITE_OPENAI_KEY=sk-your-key-here
#
# OPTION C — No key (default):
#   RAG still works via SQL search (finds real vendors from DB).
#   Budget/timeline/vendor planning all work via VEDA engine.
#   Vector semantic search only activates when VITE_OPENAI_KEY is set.

